Research Title: Type 1 Diabetes Technology

This project explores how modern technology helps people with type 1 diabetes monitor glucose levels, manage insulin delivery, and organize or share diabetes information.

Research Subtopics

Continuous Glucose Monitoring (CGM)
Insulin Pumps and Automated Insulin Delivery
Diabetes Apps, Data Management, and Telehealth
